  "task1_cython_port": {
    "operator_used_for_study": "Numba phi_K4_halo (parallel=True, 4 threads) -- faster than the single-threaded Cython port; symmetry reduction is the main tractability win, so we use the faster operator. Cython port built + bit-exact validated.",
